Root cause:
The bug was caused by the `IndexWriter` attempting to open a corrupt index that was missing its `segments_N` file, which led to a NullPointerException (NPE) when the code tried to access the current segments file. The logic did not properly handle the absence of this critical file, resulting in an unhandled null reference.

Code statements information:
The code statements that lead to the bug are:
```java
